              "type": "text",
              "text": "Two people are eating at a restaurant.",
              "marks": []
            },
            {
              "type": "break"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "A fancy dish costs three times as much as a regular dish.",
              "marks": []
            },
            {
              "type": "break"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "If they order one of each and the total bill is $68, how much is the fancy dish?",
              "marks": []
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    "layout": "list",
    "columns": null,
    "questionDiagrams": [],
    "children": [],
    "answer": {
      "short": "\\$51.",
      "worked": "Let $x$ be the price of the regular dish in dollars. The fancy dish costs $3x$ dollars.\n$$\\begin{align*}x+3x&=68\\\\4x&=68\\\\x&=17\\\\3x&=3(17)=51\\end{align*}$$\nThe fancy dish costs \\$51.\nCheck: $17+51=68$ and $51=3(17)$.",
      "solutionDiagrams": []
    },
    "answerSpaceMm": 51
  },
